  "prefLabel": "Env-C 213.04 Waiver of Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 213.04 Waiver of Requirements.\n\n(a) The commissioner shall waive any or all of RSA 21-G:37, II - IV for any RFA, RFB, RFP, or similar invitation if the waiver is necessary to:\n\n(1) Prevent the loss of federal or other funds subject to recapture; or\n\n(2) Prevent or mitigate an emergency situation as defined in Env-C 213.03(c).\n\n(b) The department shall post the information required by RSA 21-G:37, II and III as soon as practicable after the emergency situation that gave rise to the need for the waiver has been mitigated.\n\nSource. #12386, eff 9-22-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-c200.html"
}
